<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lion Nathan appoints new Australian MD.</title>
<headline>Lion Nathan appoints new Australian MD.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer Lion Nathan Ltd said on Thursday it had appointed Gordon Cairns, currently managing director of Pepsi Cola Bottlers Australia, as managing director of Lion's Australian brewing operations.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately.</p>
<p>Lion Nathan said the recently announced move by Tony van Kralingen from South Africa to take up this position was unable to be completed.</p>
<p>The previous managing director of Lion Nathan Australia, Leon L'Huillier, announced in June he would step down.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
